				\begin{document}$${\text{Colony}}\;{\text{Forming}}\;{\text{Units}}\;{\text{per}}\;{\text{mL}}\;{\text{(CFU}}/{\text{mL)}} = \frac{N}{d} \times V$$\end{document}ColonyFormingUnitspermL(CFU/mL)=Nd×Vwhere N is the number of colonies on the counting plate; d is the sampling volume (mL); V is the dilution multiple.
